{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-92"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-talk-403816600-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 관중석 외곽에 서 있다. 인파로 인해 방호창에 얼굴을 밀착시킨 채로 말이다. 진공 상태의 우주선은 준비를 마치고 대기 중이다. 나중에 그 궤적을 분명하게 볼 수 있도록 10광년 이내의 운석권에 센서가 깔려 있다","talkId":403816600,"textHash":"10206929448433993456","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/talk-403816600","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9a279aec8644eb6a","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-talk-403816601-line"],"bwikiPage":"速度与引擎","bwikiRevision":64511,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14339","bwikiMission":"엔진의 질주"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-talk-403816601-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「호모 사피엔스, 지능 기계, 머리에 파인애플꽃이 자란 지능 식물 여러분, 은하 우주선 레이싱 현장에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 여러분의 열정을 보여주세요!」","talkId":403816601,"textHash":"6680750302978924197","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/talk-403816601","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9a279aec8644eb6a","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-talk-403816602-line"],"bwikiPage":"速度与引擎","bwikiRevision":64511,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14339","bwikiMission":"엔진의 질주"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-talk-403816602-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"이어서 관중석을 날려버릴 뻔한 폭발이 일며 여러 개의 섬광이 어둠을 가른다. 관객들은 선수들이 대박을 가져다주기를 기대하며 앞다투어 칩을 건다","talkId":403816602,"textHash":"1030320282951500950","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/talk-403816602","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9a279aec8644eb6a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"速度与引擎","bwikiRevision":64511,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14339","bwikiMission":"엔진의 질주"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-text-9554410058842498730-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"가장 빠른 배에 건다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9554410058842498730","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/text-9554410058842498730","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cae586f50ddb6d57","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-text-13174767034945651755-effect"],"bwikiPage":"速度与引擎","bwikiRevision":64511,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14339","bwikiMission":"엔진의 질주"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-text-13174767034945651755-effect","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"당신에게 어울리는 광입자 압축식 엔진","talkId":null,"textHash":"13174767034945651755","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/text-13174767034945651755","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cae586f50ddb6d57","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"速度与引擎","bwikiRevision":64511,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14339","bwikiMission":"엔진의 질주","bwikiReplyToIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-text-9554410058842498730-choice"]},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-92-text-17771023151299076137-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-92","missionId":"event-rogue-92","mission":"엔진의 질주","scene":"엔진의 질주","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"가장 안정적인 배에 건다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17771023151299076137","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:92/text-17771023151299076137","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0e27bfa864f2c6e3","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-r